      "message": "\u003e If so, should every I2C bus a config refers to be pinned with a DT alias\n\nOnly bus config referring to root I2C controllers\n\n\u003e including the channels behind a mux?\n\nSo not these. These are can be understood by the topology described using the `Segment` properties.\n\n\u003e USB bus numbers cannot be pinned that way since they follow HCD registration order, so a controller path such as 1e6a3000.usb might be more stable there.\n\nThe proposal is just the existing root hub ID strategy already employed in EM for USB.",
